WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.010
Is the trend over, or will it continue? One line tells you.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.880
Break of Structure: a close above the last high. The trend continues.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:17.280
Step one: mark the last high.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:22.970
Step two: wait for a candle close above it. A wick isn't enough.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.850
Step three: enter on the pullback, not on the breakout candle.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:33.380
Common mistake: trading every break on M1. Check H4 first.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:38.680
I share setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
